title: Why freediving
---

<div class="page mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <section class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_390px] lg:gap-14">
    <div>
      <h1 class="page-title mb-12 mt-0">Freediving gives you your life back.</h1>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">The whole underwater world is in the first ten metres.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-10">Out over open water, below that, there is nothing left to look at. So you look inward.</p>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Everything shows up at once.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-10">You hold your breath and go under, and every thought you have comes down with you. You start letting them go, one at a time.</p>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Then there is room for you.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">At first your mind fights back. On the way down it shouts: get out, we are drowning. Calm it down and it goes quiet. That quiet comes up with you, and it is still there at&nbsp;3&nbsp;a.m.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full max-w-[390px]">
